version: "corelm-portfolio-v13"
date-released: 2026-08-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ALLPROTO/core-lm-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/ALLPROTO/core-lm-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An open-source macOS and Linux benchmark for complete-container KV-cache
  compression. The artifact builds locally, evaluates pinned real-Qwen
  workloads, retains raw and per-token evidence, and verifies results through
  separate structural and heavyweight replay paths. Blind V1 is preserved as
  a retired, unrun draft and is not a result of this software release.
keywords:
  - state trajectory compression
  - KV-cache compression
  - language-model inference
  - reproducible evaluation
  - reproducible benchmark
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "VoidToken v5: Prospectively Frozen Evidence for KV-Cache Compression on a Real Language Model"
